4. APFE Architecture: Multi‑Agent System Design

The AI Problem Framing Engine (APFE) is specified as a cooperative‑adversarial multi‑agent system with a shared blackboard. The architecture comprises four core agents; extensions remain optional.

4.1 Architectural Diagram

